Asia-Pacific: This region is witnessing truly exponential growth, particularly within the key markets of China, India, and Japan itself.
Middle East & Africa: While alcohol consumption faces restrictions in many Middle Eastern nations, the robust hospitality and luxury tourism sectors there contribute meaningfully to high-end whisky sales.

